  "blurb2": "He was part of the original 1992 Dream Team, a roster so loaded that even a franchise cornerstone like Ewing was fine settling into a complementary role. Knicks fans still argue about how differently his résumé might read if he'd played in almost any other era, given how consistently great he was across a genuinely stacked stretch of competition at his position.",
