  "blurb2": "Pettit played with a relentlessness that showed up mostly on the boards, crashing the glass on both ends of the floor every single possession. He retired with career averages that still hold up remarkably well by any era's standard, a reminder that the fundamentals of good rebounding and consistent scoring translate across basically any decade of the sport.",
