  "blurb2": "He's one of the most efficient shooters ever to play, landing in the 50-40-90 club, fifty percent from the field, forty from three, ninety from the line, multiple times in his career, a statistical club so exclusive that only a handful of players have ever joined it even once. As a Canadian point guard who reshaped offensive geometry for an entire era, Nash's fingerprints are all over how modern NBA teams now think about spacing.",
